---
interface Props {
  routine: 'high' | 'soft' | 'ear' | 'english' | 'song';
}
const { routine } = Astro.props;
const titles = {
  high: '高音 / 换区：跟着做',
  soft: '弱唱 / 动态：跟着做',
  ear: '音准 / 听唱：跟着做',
  english: '英文节奏：跟着做',
  song: '歌曲落地：跟着做',
};
---

<guided-vocal-trainer data-routine={routine}>
  <section class="guided-trainer" aria-labelledby={`guided-trainer-${routine}`}>
    <div class="guided-trainer__heading">
      <span>无脑跟练模式</span>
      <h2 id={`guided-trainer-${routine}`}>{titles[routine]}</h2>
      <p>按一次开始。页面负责给音、倒数、顺序和休息；你只需要跟着当前大字提示做。到检查点再按一个按钮。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="guided-trainer__controls">
      <label>
        <span>舒适起音</span>
        <select data-root>
          <option value="45">A2</option>
          <option value="46">B♭2</option>
          <option value="47">B2</option>
          <option value="48" selected>C3</option>
          <option value="50">D3</option>
          <option value="52">E3</option>
          <option value="53">F3</option>
          <option value="55">G3</option>
          <option value="57">A3</option>
          <option value="59">B3</option>
          <option value="60">C4</option>
        </select>
        <small>只选今天能小音量轻松发出的音。高音训练也从舒服位置开始。</small>
      </label>
      <label>
        <span>速度</span>
        <select data-bpm>
          <option value="50">50 BPM · 更慢</option>
          <option value="60" selected>60 BPM · 默认</option>
          <option value="72">72 BPM · 熟悉后</option>
        </select>
        <small>第一次用这页保持 60 BPM；不要为了“跟上”提高速度。</small>
      </label>
    </div>

    <div class="guided-trainer__actions">
      <button type="button" data-start>开始这次跟练</button>
      <button type="button" data-stop disabled>停止</button>
      <button type="button" data-preview>试听起音</button>
    </div>

    <div class="guided-trainer__stage" aria-live="polite">
      <span data-step>等待开始</span>
      <strong data-instruction>选好舒适起音，然后按“开始这次跟练”。</strong>
      <div class="guided-trainer__pattern" data-pattern>—</div>
      <div class="guided-trainer__timer" data-timer>—</div>
    </div>

    <div class="guided-trainer__choices" data-choices hidden>
      <p data-check-text>只判断刚才这组，不评价整堂课。</p>
      <div>
        <button type="button" data-choice="pass">舒服 / 可重复，继续</button>
        <button type="button" data-choice="repeat">不确定 / 有点吃力，重做</button>
        <button type="button" data-choice="stop">不舒服，今天停止</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <progress data-progress max="100" value="0">0%</progress>
    <p class="guided-trainer__note" data-note>
      训练器不监听也不评分。疼痛、刺激、沙哑或说话费力时直接停止，不用完成进度条。
    </p>
  </section>
</guided-vocal-trainer>

